<e><p><l>vengeance<s n="n"/></l><r>vendetta<s n="n"/><s n="f"/></r></p></e>
<e><p><l>escalation<s n="n"/></l><r>escalation<s n="n"/><s n="f"/></r></p></e>
<e><p><l>crowded<s n="adj"/></l><r>affollato<s n="adj"/></r></p></e>
<e><p><l>appear<s n="vblex"/></l><r>apparire<s n="vblex"/></r></p></e>
# `un intercambio de fuego' is an exchange of fire -- `scambio', where the
