<e><p><l>affected<s n="adj"/></l><r>interessato<s n="adj"/></r></p></e>
<e><p><l>planned<s n="adj"/></l><r>previsto<s n="adj"/></r></p></e>
# `impedire' is in apertium-ita.ita.dix and in no bilingual entry, and it is
# the Italian word for the English `prevent' that the Spanish `impedir' takes
# first: the dictionary's own is `prevenire', which is to forestall
<e><p><l>prevent<s n="vblex"/></l><r>impedire<s n="vblex"/></r></p></e>
# `a determinadas horas' -- at certain hours: the Spanish `determinado' is
# `determinate' to the dictionary, and apertium-ita carries `determinato' with
# its paradigm and no English word
<e><p><l>determinate<s n="adj"/></l><r>determinato<s n="adj"/></r></p></e>
# the Quartieri article (Venice treebank VIT, hip hop workshops at Tor Bella
# Monaca), into Spanish: the Italian words for the English ones the Spanish
# entries below write. Each has its paradigm in apertium-ita.ita.dix and no
# English word, or one the translator cannot use, and all are read only (RL)
# but `coinvolgere'. (`le varie espressioni' and `sudafricani' are in
# extra/italian.txt: `vario' is `various' to the dictionary, which is no
# determiner the builder admits, and the builder reads no entry of two English
# words.) `arti visive':
<e r="RL"><p><l>visual<s n="adj"/></l><r>visivo<s n="adj"/></r></p></e>
# `Graffiti per colorare il grigio delle metropoli' and `la violenza che dilaga
# tra i giovani': a graffito, and violence that proliferates
<e r="RL"><p><l>graffito<s n="n"/></l><r>graffito<s n="n"/><s n="m"/></r></p></e>
<e r="RL"><p><l>proliferate<s n="vblex"/></l><r>dilagare<s n="vblex"/></r></p></e>
# `in cui immergersi', `coinvolge ragazzi', `i giovani emarginati', `andare a
# quattro zampe', `nei campi prescelti', `contributo ... devoluto alla Lega'.
# `coinvolgere' is LR and not RL: an RL entry for `involve' comes before the
# dictionary's LR one for `implicare', which the builder then drops as both its
# words seen, and `implica' lost its second meaning, involves
<e r="RL"><p><l>submerge<s n="vblex"/></l><r>immergere<s n="vblex"/></r></p></e>
<e r="LR"><p><l>involve<s n="vblex"/></l><r>coinvolgere<s n="vblex"/></r></p></e>
